1017:      * The trigger request is failed prematurely without a proper initialization. There is no
1018:      * resource to release, but the completion promise needs to fail manually here.
1019:      *
1020:      * @param onCompletionPromise the completion promise of the checkpoint/savepoint
1021:      * @param throwable the reason of trigger failure
1022:      */
1023:     private void onTriggerFailure(
1024:             CheckpointTriggerRequest onCompletionPromise, Throwable throwable) {
1025:         final CheckpointException checkpointException =
1026:                 getCheckpointException(
1027:                         CheckpointFailureReason.TRIGGER_CHECKPOINT_FAILURE, throwable);
1028:         onCompletionPromise.completeExceptionally(checkpointException);
1029:         onTriggerFailure((PendingCheckpoint) null, onCompletionPromise.props, checkpointException);
