2212:     /**
2213:      * Discards the given state object asynchronously belonging to the given job, execution attempt
2214:      * id and checkpoint id.
2215:      *
2216:      * @param jobId identifying the job to which the state object belongs
2217:      * @param executionAttemptID identifying the task to which the state object belongs
2218:      * @param checkpointId of the state object
2219:      * @param subtaskState to discard asynchronously
