215:      * The network data output implementation used for processing stream elements from {@link
216:      * StreamTaskNetworkInput} in one input processor.
217:      */
218:     private static class StreamTaskNetworkOutput<IN> implements DataOutput<IN> {
219: 
220:         private final Input<IN> operator;
